      {"id": "2-13", "title": "第 13 题　计算题", "kind": "计算题", "body": "<p>试用KCL、KVL求解图2.2所示电路中的电流<span class=\"math-inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></math><img src=\"images/1c524fe041542538c9dd.png\" alt=\"i\" class=\"math-fallback\"></span>。 <br><img src=\"images/f82dd7e7b6b78fcec528.png\" alt=\"第 13 题题干图\" class=\"review-figure\" width=\"529\"> <br>图2.2 计算题2的图</p>", "options": [], "result": "<p>电路如图所示，列写KCL、KVL方程<br><img src=\"images/3853cbb29d1ea48238ed.png\" alt=\"第 13 题参考答案图\" class=\"review-figure\" width=\"581\"><br>计算题2解的图<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mi>:</mi><mo>&#x02212;</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>;</mi><msub><mi>i</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math><img src=\"images/8adaeaf081c56632cddb.png\" alt=\"KCL:-i_1+i+i_3+u_1=0 ; i_3=u_1(VCR)\" class=\"math-fallback\"></span><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>:</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">&#x0007B;</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"left\"><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>:</mi><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>i</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext>&#x000A0;</mtext><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>:</mi><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>i</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>i</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy=\"true\" fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" /></mrow></mrow></math><img src=\"images/8597140241a16ebebce4.png\" alt=\"KVL: \\\\beginarrayll 1:-10+4 i_1+2 i=0 \\ l 2:-10+4 i_1+u_1+2 i_1=0\\endarray.\" class=\"math-fallback\"></span><br>解之得:<span class=\"math-inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>&#x000A0;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mrow></math><img src=\"images/c6771c82db465f342429.png\" alt=\"i=i_1=(5) / (3) ~A\" class=\"math-fallback\"></span>;<span class=\"math-inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><msub><mover><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#x000AF;</mo></mover></mrow><mo>&#x002D9;</mo></mover><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>4</mn><mrow><mtext>&#x000A0;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mrow></math><img src=\"images/e37402bf72e03b6f6bf4.png\" alt=\"\\dot\\barL_2=4 ~A\" class=\"math-fallback\"></span>;<span class=\"math-inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mtext>&#x000A0;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mrow></math><img src=\"images/6770942a0b6a3140122a.png\" alt=\"u_1=0 ~V\" class=\"math-fallback\"></span></p>", "steps": [], "source": "学习通正确答案"}
